Tigro Chat app - installed on your child's phone, synchronizes with the Kid Security app

Tigro Sirius Chat is designed for the safety of schoolchildren. The parent installs the application on the child's phone to always know where he is!

In the app, the you can:
- communicate with the parent in a chat;
- complete tasks, collect coins and spend them on your dream;
- receive audio notifications from the parent in the phone mode " without sound»;
- play quizzes and win prizes.

Tigro Sirius Chat DOES NOT allow parents to:
- read personal conversations in SMS, messengers and social networks
- listen to conversations on the phone
